# MudKitchen branding

The product is **MudKitchen**, not SchoolStack.

- **User-facing copy** (build logs, emails, UI strings, timeline entries, help text): say **MudKitchen** or **MudKitchen mobile app**.
- **Internal/technical** (repo folder `schoolstack_landing`, package names, env vars, code identifiers): keep existing names — do not rename code for branding.
- When unsure, prefer "MudKitchen" for anything a school admin or parent would read.
